{# GoodPlanet and water details in use on the site (chosen by Tine on 1 October 2026; brush buttons, torn edges,
   water level, ripples, riverbank and wavy button edges were shown as options and left out). The classes are in site.css. #}
<section class="container section" id="goodplanet-touches">
  <div class="split" style="margin-bottom: var(--block)">
    <h2>GoodPlanet and water details</h2>
    <p class="sg-note">Details after goodplanet.be, drawn again for the SYP, plus the wave edge from our own waves. All are in use on the real pages. Every colour pair passes WCAG AA; the ratios are written beside each class in site.css.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="container section">
  <div class="stack">
    <div class="split">
      <h3>Round social icons</h3>
      <div>
        {% set socialOnDark = false %}{% include "blocks/social-icons.njk" %}
