        <div class="bg-deep on-dark" style="margin-top:16px; padding:24px; border-radius: var(--r-md)">
          {% set socialOnDark = true %}{% include "blocks/social-icons.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <h3>Hand-drawn underline</h3>
      <div>
        <div class="sg-row" style="gap: 16px 32px">
          <a class="link-arrow link-scribble" href="#">About the project</a>
          <a class="link-arrow link-scribble link-scribble-lime" href="#">All news</a>
          <a class="link-arrow link-scribble link-scribble-orange" href="#">See the full timeline</a>
          <a class="link-arrow link-scribble link-scribble-pink" href="#">Youth voices</a>
          <a class="link-arrow link-scribble link-scribble-green" href="#">All exchanges</a>
        </div>
        <p class="sg-note" style="margin-top:16px">.link-scribble on an arrow link, in GoodPlanet blue or with -lime, -orange, -pink or -green. The line is decoration only; the link text stays blue. goodplanet.be has a similar brush line under its "Meer info" links.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <h3>Sticker labels</h3>
      <div>
        <div class="card-grid-2">
          <div class="has-stickers">
            <ul class="stickers">
              <li class="sticker">Exchange 4</li>
              <li class="sticker sticker-lime">Ghent</li>
            </ul>
            {% photo "ghent-2026-paddles", "Four participants in life jackets holding red paddles before going on the water", { sizes: "(min-width: 900px) 360px, 100vw", class: "photo-rounded" } %}
          </div>
          <div class="has-stickers card-soft">
            <ul class="stickers">
              <li class="sticker sticker-orange">Workshop</li>
              <li class="sticker sticker-green">Rights of nature</li>
              <li class="sticker sticker-brown">2025</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 style="margin:24px 0 12px">Do rivers have rights?</h3>
            <p>A weekend at the water in Zeeland, with kayaks and the Go with the flow game.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="sg-note" style="margin-top:16px">.stickers inside .has-stickers: small labels that hang over the corner of a photo or card, like the category labels on goodplanet.be. In blue, -lime, -orange, -green and -brown; not in pink, because white on pink is too weak for small text.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section" id="water-touches">
  <div class="stack">
    <div class="split">
      <h3>Wave edge on photos</h3>
      <div>
        <div class="card-grid-2">
          <figure style="margin:0">
            {% photo "ghent-2026-bikes-selfie", "Participants on bicycles in a Ghent street, taking a selfie", { class: "photo-wave-edge", sizes: "(min-width: 900px) 330px, 100vw" } %}
